{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42521","headline":"记皂江堕水事 · 杨鼎夫","name":"记皂江堕水事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青城山峭皂江寒，欲度当时作等闲。\n櫂逆狂风趋近岸，舟逢怪石碎前湾。\n手携弱杖仓皇处，命出洪涛顷刻间。\n今日深恩无以报，令人羞记雀衔环。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨鼎夫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}